<title>ZAMBIA: Property company fourth to list on Lusaka exchange.</title>
<headline>Property company fourth to list on Lusaka exchange.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment company Farmers House Plc on Tuesday became the fourth company to list on Zambia's two-year-old stock market, the Lusaka Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>A fifth company, Zambia Sugar, is scheduled to be listed on September 27.</p>
<p>Existing listings comprise Chilanga Cement, tobacco group Rothmans and giant copper concern Zambia Consolidated Copper Mines (ZCCM).</p>
